{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_newstudents

    The sheet «Los alumnos nuevos» of the numbers (Jujol, 21 November 2026): what really happened with the new
    students of a school year, so that the head of a centre is not fooled by raw numbers. Three sheets:
    - what it seems and what really happens, in two sentences side by side;
    - where the new students come from, one backpack per student: in pencil those who were already of the centre
      (an inner step, or a brother or sister), in aubergine those of new families, by what they left before;
    - what each ad brought: the way from the families who left their contact to those who enrolled, a hundred dots
      for «out of every hundred», and what each new student cost at most.
    Above all, what comes out of the numbers: strengths, weak points and trends in sentences, each with its number and
    its why, from fixed rules or from the centre's AI reading when it is on (marked). Each campaign and each act says
    its money and the hours of the team side by side, never added up unless the centre gives a value to an hour (then
    in pencil, «≈»); «Las horas del equipo» opens what Eguahe counts by itself and the lines the centre writes, with − and +,
    saved at each gesture.
    Every number is a button: touched, pointed or focused, the box at its side says what it is, how it is counted and
    what to keep in mind; the same texts, all together, in «Cómo se cuenta cada cifra», which also reads without the
    script. The switch «Con o sin los que ya eran del centro» is two links (?centro=0); both versions of every changing
    figure are in the page (spans .con and .sin), so the script only swaps a class and the URL.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "withcentre": true,
        "truth": {"seems": "500 familias dejaron su contacto en un anuncio y hay 40 alumnos nuevos.", "is": "25 de los 40 ya eran del centro."},
        "origins": {"cut": "Curso 2026-27", "heroall": "15 de 40", "heronew": "8 de 15", "heroalltext": "son de familias nuevas", "heronewtext": "habían dejado antes su contacto en un anuncio",
            "rows": [{"key": "inner", "name": "Ya estaban en el centro", "sub": "Pasan de su guardería o de otra etapa", "n": 15, "pct": "38 %", "pctnew": "", "centre": true, "explain": "ex-inner", "courses": "Infantil 3 años 12", "bags": [{"k": "inner"}], "hasparts": false, "parts": []}],
            "fold": "25 ya eran del centro y no cuentan aquí.", "unfoldurl": "#", "table": [{"name": "Ya estaban en el centro", "n": 15, "pct": "38 %"}]},
        "ads": {"heroall": "8 de 40", "heronew": "8 de 15", "heroalltext": "alumnos nuevos, como mucho, salieron de los anuncios", "heronewtext": "alumnos de familias nuevas, como mucho, salieron de los anuncios",
            "campaigns": [{"key": "otono", "label": "Anuncios de otoño", "when": "De septiembre a noviembre", "contacts": 320, "centre": 20, "newcontacts": 300,
                "allin": 16, "newin": 6, "allper": 5, "newper": 2, "alldots": [{"k": "n"}], "newdots": [{"k": "n"}], "allsentence": "", "newsentence": "",
                "each": "207 €", "cost": "Costó 1.240 €.", "students": 6, "ex": {"contacts": "ex-a1", "centre": "ex-a2", "in": "ex-a3", "per": "ex-a4", "each": "ex-a5"} }],
            "table": []},
        "explain": [{"id": "ex-inner", "title": "15 ya estaban en el centro", "what": "", "how": "", "careful": ""}]
    }
}}
<div class="alumnos-nuevos{{^withcentre}} sin-centro{{/withcentre}}" data-alumnos-nuevos>
    <svg class="an-dibujos" width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <symbol id="an-birrete" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.5 9.5L12 5l9.5 4.5L12 14z" style="fill: var(--eg-tinta); stroke: var(--eg-tinta); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linejoin: round"/><path d="M21.5 9.5v5" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--eg-tinta); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round"/></symbol><symbol id="an-mochila" viewBox="0 0 16 18"><path d="M5.6 4.1V3.3C5.6 1.9 6.6 1 8 1s2.4.9 2.4 2.3v.8" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--m-linea); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-linecap: round"/><path d="M2.6 8.2c0-2.5 1.9-4.2 4.3-4.2h2.2c2.4 0 4.3 1.7 4.3 4.2v7c0 .8-.6 1.4-1.4 1.4H4c-.8 0-1.4-.6-1.4-1.4z" style="fill: var(--m-relleno); stroke: var(--m-linea); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-dasharray: var(--m-trazo, none)"/><path d="M4.6 10.4h6.8v2H4.6z" style="fill: var(--m-banda)"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="an-fuerte" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10.5"/><path d="M7 13.5l3.2 3.2L17.5 9" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--an-sobre, #fff); stroke-width: 2.4; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="an-flojo" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2.2l10.2 18.3H1.8z"/><path d="M12 9v5.2M12 17.4v.1" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--an-sobre, #fff); stroke-width: 2.4; stroke-linecap: round"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="an-tendencia" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1.5" y="1.5" width="21" height="21" rx="5"/><path d="M6 16.5l4.5-4.5 3 3L18 9.5M13.8 9.5H18v4.2" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--an-sobre, #fff); stroke-width: 2.2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="an-toca" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11.5V5.2a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 3.2 0V11l.2-1.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 3.1.5l-.1 1.6.1-.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 3.1.6l-.2 2.3c-.4 3.8-2.6 6.4-6 6.4-2.5 0-4.2-1.3-5.4-3.5L5.4 13a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 2.4-1.7z"/></symbol>
    </svg>

    {{#conclusions}}
    <section class="lamina an-conclusiones ancha" aria-labelledby="an-conc-t" id="conclusiones">
        <h2 id="an-conc-t">{{#str}}panel_new_conclusions_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <ul class="an-concs">
            {{#items}}
            <li class="an-conc an-conc-{{kind}}{{#ai}} an-conc-ia{{/ai}}">
                <svg class="an-conc-marca" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#an-{{kind}}"/></svg>
                <div>
                    <p class="an-conc-tipo">{{kindname}}{{#ai}}<span class="an-ia">{{#str}}panel_new_ai_reads, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span>{{/ai}}</p>
                    <p class="an-conc-frase">{{{text}}}</p>
                    <p class="an-conc-porque"><b>{{#str}}panel_new_why, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</b> {{why}} <a class="enlace" href="#{{anchor}}">{{#str}}panel_new_see, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a></p>
                </div>
            </li>
            {{/items}}
        </ul>
        <p class="def">{{def}}</p>
    </section>
    {{/conclusions}}

    {{#truth}}
    <section class="lamina an-verdad ancha" aria-labelledby="an-verdad-t" id="lo-que-pasa">
        <h2 id="an-verdad-t">{{#str}}panel_new_truth_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <div class="an-cuerpo">
            <div class="an-pares">
                <div class="an-parece"><p class="an-rotulo">{{#str}}panel_new_seems, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p><p class="an-frase">{{{seems}}}</p></div>
                <div class="an-pasa"><p class="an-rotulo">{{#str}}panel_new_is, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p><p class="an-frase">{{{is}}}</p></div>
            </div>
            <aside class="an-explica" data-explica-caja aria-live="polite"><p class="an-reposo"><svg class="an-toca" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#an-toca"/></svg>{{#str}}panel_new_touch, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p></aside>
        </div>
    </section>
    {{/truth}}

    {{#origins}}
    <section class="lamina an-origen ancha" aria-labelledby="an-origen-t" id="de-donde" data-an-grafico>
        <h2 id="an-origen-t">{{#str}}panel_origins_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <p class="an-heroe"><b><span class="con">{{heroall}}</span><span class="sin">{{heronew}}</span></b><span><span class="con">{{heroalltext}}</span><span class="sin">{{heronewtext}}</span></span></p>
        <div class="an-cuerpo">
            <ul class="an-baldas">
                {{#rows}}
                <li class="an-balda an-{{key}}{{#centre}} del-centro{{/centre}}" data-balda="{{key}}">
                    <button type="button" class="an-toque an-balda-que" data-explica="{{explain}}" data-marca="{{key}}">
                        <b class="an-n">{{n}}</b>
                        <span class="an-nombre">{{name}}{{#sub}}<small>{{sub}}</small>{{/sub}}</span>
                        <span class="an-pct"><span class="con">{{pct}}</span><span class="sin">{{pctnew}}</span></span>
                    </button>
                    <span class="an-mochilas" aria-hidden="true">{{#bags}}{{#alumni}}<span class="an-antigua"><svg class="an-mochila m-{{k}}" viewBox="0 0 16 18" focusable="false"><use href="#an-mochila"/></svg><svg class="an-birrete-mini" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><use href="#an-birrete"/></svg></span>{{/alumni}}{{^alumni}}<svg class="an-mochila m-{{k}}" viewBox="0 0 16 18" focusable="false"><use href="#an-mochila"/></svg>{{/alumni}}{{/bags}}</span>
                    {{#courses}}<span class="an-cursos">{{courses}}</span>{{/courses}}
                    {{#hasparts}}
                    <ul class="an-partes">
                        {{#parts}}<li><button type="button" class="an-toque an-parte" data-explica="{{explain}}" data-marca="{{key}}"><svg class="an-mochila m-{{key}}" viewBox="0 0 16 18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#an-mochila"/></svg><b>{{n}}</b> {{name}}</button></li>{{/parts}}
                    </ul>
                    {{/hasparts}}
                </li>
                {{/rows}}
            </ul>
            <aside class="an-explica" data-explica-caja aria-live="polite"><p class="an-reposo"><svg class="an-toca" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#an-toca"/></svg>{{#str}}panel_new_touch, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p></aside>
        </div>
        {{#alumni}}<p class="an-antiguos"><svg class="an-birrete" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 9.5L12 5l9.5 4.5L12 14z"/><path d="M6.5 11.8v4c1.5 1.4 3.4 2.2 5.5 2.2s4-.8 5.5-2.2v-4M21.5 9.5v5"/></svg><span>{{{.}}}</span></p>{{/alumni}}
        {{#nosiblings}}<p class="secundario an-sin-lista">{{#str}}panel_origins_noroll, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>{{/nosiblings}}
        <p class="an-plegado sin">{{fold}} <a class="enlace" href="{{unfoldurl}}" data-cuenta="con">{{#str}}panel_new_count_them, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a></p>
        <details class="tabla-gemela"><summary>{{#str}}panel_as_table, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</summary>
            <table class="tabla-panel"><thead><tr><th scope="col">{{cut}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_students, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_share, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>{{#table}}<tr{{#part}} class="parte"{{/part}}><th scope="row">{{name}}</th><td>{{n}}</td><td>{{pct}}</td></tr>{{/table}}</tbody></table>
        </details>
    </section>
    {{/origins}}

    {{#ads}}
    <section class="lamina an-anuncios ancha" aria-labelledby="an-anuncios-t" id="publicidad">
        <h2 id="an-anuncios-t">{{#str}}panel_new_brought_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <p class="an-heroe"><b><span class="con">{{heroall}}</span><span class="sin">{{heronew}}</span></b><span><span class="con">{{heroalltext}}</span><span class="sin">{{heronewtext}}</span></span></p>
        {{#hoursnote}}<p class="def an-horas-nota">{{hoursnote}}</p>{{/hoursnote}}
        <div class="an-cuerpo">
            <ol class="an-campanas">
                {{#campaigns}}
                <li class="an-campana{{#act}} an-acto{{/act}}">
                    <p class="an-campana-cab"><b>{{label}}</b><span>{{when}}</span>{{#act}}<span class="an-sello-acto">{{#str}}panel_new_act, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span>{{/act}}</p>
                    <ol class="an-camino">
                        <li><button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{ex.contacts}}"><b>{{contacts}}</b><span>{{steplabel}}</span></button></li>
                        {{#centre}}<li class="an-resta"><button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{ex.centre}}"><b><span class="sin">−</span>{{centre}}</b><span>{{#str}}panel_new_were_centre, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span></button></li>
                        <li class="an-nuevas sin"><span class="an-dato"><b>{{newcontacts}}</b><span>{{#act}}{{#str}}panel_new_step_new_act, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}{{/act}}{{^act}}{{#str}}panel_new_step_new, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}{{/act}}</span></span></li>{{/centre}}
                        <li class="an-llegan{{#nonew}} sin-nuevas{{/nonew}}"><button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{ex.in}}"><b><span class="con">{{allin}}</span><span class="sin">{{newin}}</span></b><span><span class="con">{{#str}}panel_new_enrolled_all, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><span class="sin">{{#str}}panel_new_enrolled_new, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span></span></button></li>
                    </ol>
                    <div class="an-cien">
                        <span class="an-puntos con" aria-hidden="true">{{#alldots}}<i class="p-{{k}}"></i>{{/alldots}}</span>
                        <span class="an-puntos sin" aria-hidden="true">{{#newdots}}<i class="p-{{k}}"></i>{{/newdots}}</span>
                        <button type="button" class="an-toque an-cien-frase" data-explica="{{ex.per}}"><span class="con">{{{allsentence}}}</span><span class="sin">{{{newsentence}}}</span></button>
                        {{#otheryear}}<p class="def an-otro-curso">{{otheryear}}</p>{{/otheryear}}
                    </div>
                    <dl class="an-cuesta">
                        <div class="an-cuesta-dinero"><dt>{{#str}}panel_new_money, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</dt><dd>{{#moneynone}}<span class="an-sin-dato">{{money}}</span>{{/moneynone}}{{^moneynone}}<button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{ex.money}}"><b>{{money}}</b></button>{{/moneynone}}<small>{{moneywhat}}</small>
                            {{#canspend}}<details class="an-anotar"><summary class="enlace">{{#moneynone}}{{#str}}panel_new_money_note, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}{{/moneynone}}{{^moneynone}}{{#str}}panel_new_money_change, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}{{/moneynone}}</summary>
                                <form method="post" action="{{saveurl}}#publicidad"><input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="actspend"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{scopeid}}">
                                    <label for="an-gasto-{{key}}">{{#str}}panel_new_money_what, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</label><span class="an-anotar-fila"><input id="an-gasto-{{key}}" name="amount" value="{{moneyvalue}}" inputmode="decimal" size="8" autocomplete="off"><span>{{currency}}</span><button class="boton secundario pequeno" type="submit">{{#str}}panel_new_money_save, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</button></span>
                                    <small>{{#str}}panel_new_money_help, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</small>
                                </form>
                            </details>{{/canspend}}</dd></div>
                        <div class="an-cuesta-horas"><dt>{{#str}}panel_new_hours, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</dt><dd><button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{ex.hours}}"><b data-horas-total>{{hours}}</b></button><small data-horas-dinero>{{hoursmoney}}</small></dd></div>
                        <div class="an-cuesta-alumno"><dt>{{#str}}panel_new_each_student_cap, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</dt><dd><button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{ex.each}}">{{#eachnone}}<span class="an-sin-dato" data-horas-alumno>{{each}}</span>{{/eachnone}}{{^eachnone}}<b data-horas-alumno>{{each}}</b>{{/eachnone}}</button><small data-horas-alumno-dinero>{{eachmoney}}</small></dd></div>
                    </dl>
                    <details class="an-parte" data-parte-horas data-alumnos="{{students}}" data-dinero="{{moneyn}}" data-guardar="{{saveurl}}" data-sesskey="{{sesskey}}" data-ambito="{{scope}}" data-id="{{scopeid}}" data-moneda="{{currency}}"{{#open}} open{{/open}}>
                        <summary>{{#str}}panel_new_hours_open, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</summary>
                        <div class="an-parte-cuerpo">
                            <p class="an-parte-t">{{#str}}panel_new_hours_auto, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
                            {{#hasauto}}<ul class="an-horas-solas">{{#autohours}}<li data-horas="{{h}}"><b>{{hl}}</b><span>{{name}}</span></li>{{/autohours}}</ul>{{/hasauto}}
                            {{^hasauto}}<p class="an-horas-nada">{{#str}}panel_new_hours_auto_none, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>{{/hasauto}}
                            <p class="an-parte-t">{{#str}}panel_new_hours_written, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
                            <ul class="an-horas-centro" data-horas-lista>
                                {{#written}}<li class="an-hora" data-horas="{{h}}" data-tarea="{{task}}"><span class="an-hora-que">{{name}}</span><span class="an-paso">{{#canwrite}}<button type="button" class="an-menos-h" data-paso="-1" aria-label="{{#str}}panel_new_hour_less, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}} {{name}}">−</button>{{/canwrite}}<b aria-live="polite">{{hl}}</b>{{#canwrite}}<button type="button" class="an-mas-h" data-paso="1" aria-label="{{#str}}panel_new_hour_more, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}} {{name}}">+</button>{{/canwrite}}</span></li>{{/written}}
                            </ul>
                            {{#hastasks}}<p class="an-tareas"><span>{{#str}}panel_new_hours_add, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span>{{#tasks}}<button type="button" class="pastilla an-tarea" data-tarea="{{task}}" data-nombre="{{name}}">+ {{name}}</button>{{/tasks}}</p>{{/hastasks}}
                            <p class="an-valor"><span>{{#str}}panel_new_hour_value, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><span class="an-paso">{{#canwrite}}<button type="button" data-valor="-1" aria-label="{{#str}}panel_new_hour_value_less, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}">−</button>{{/canwrite}}<b data-valor-hora="{{value}}">{{valuel}}</b>{{#canwrite}}<button type="button" data-valor="1" aria-label="{{#str}}panel_new_hour_value_more, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}">+</button>{{/canwrite}}</span><small>{{#str}}panel_new_hour_value_help, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</small></p>
                            <p class="an-guardado" data-guardado aria-live="polite"></p>
                        </div>
                    </details>
                </li>
                {{/campaigns}}
            </ol>
            <aside class="an-explica" data-explica-caja aria-live="polite"><p class="an-reposo"><svg class="an-toca" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#an-toca"/></svg>{{#str}}panel_new_touch, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p></aside>
        </div>
        <p class="def">{{#str}}panel_ads_def, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
        <details class="tabla-gemela"><summary>{{#str}}panel_as_table, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</summary>
            <table class="tabla-panel"><thead><tr><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_campaign, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_left_contact_short, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_were_centre_short, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_enrolled_short, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_per_hundred, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_each_short, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>{{#campaigns}}<tr><th scope="row">{{label}}</th><td>{{contacts}}</td><td>{{centre}}</td><td><span class="con">{{allin}}</span><span class="sin">{{newin}}</span></td><td><span class="con">{{allper}}</span><span class="sin">{{newper}}</span></td><td>{{each}}</td></tr>{{/campaigns}}</tbody></table>
        </details>
    </section>
    {{/ads}}

    {{#moves}}
    <section class="lamina an-mueve ancha" aria-labelledby="an-mueve-t" id="altas-y-bajas">
        <h2 id="an-mueve-t">{{#str}}panel_new_moves_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <p class="an-al-dia">{{cut}}</p>
        <div class="an-heroe an-heroe-doble">
            <button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{exjoins}}"><b class="an-mas">+{{joins}}</b><span>{{#str}}panel_new_joins, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="an-toque" data-explica="{{exleaves}}"><b class="an-menos">−{{leaves}}</b><span>{{#str}}panel_new_leaves, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span></button>
            <p class="an-tendencia">{{trend}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="an-cuerpo">
            <div class="an-mueve-dibujo">
                <p class="leyenda an-leyenda" aria-hidden="true"><span class="clave"><i class="an-k an-k-mas"></i>{{#str}}panel_new_joins, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><span class="clave"><i class="an-k an-k-menos"></i>{{#str}}panel_new_leaves, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><span class="clave clave-lapiz"><i class="an-k an-k-antes"></i>{{#str}}panel_new_last_year, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span></p>
                <ol class="an-meses">
                    {{#months}}
                    <li class="an-mes{{#future}} futuro{{/future}}{{#current}} ahora{{/current}}" style="--a: {{av}}; --b: {{bv}}; --ga: {{gav}}; --gb: {{gbv}}">
                        <button type="button" class="an-toque an-mes-toque" data-explica="{{explain}}">
                            <span class="an-mes-mas"><i class="an-fantasma" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="an-barra" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>{{joinsn}}</b></span>
                            <span class="an-mes-menos"><i class="an-fantasma" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="an-barra" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>{{leavesn}}</b></span>
                            <span class="an-mes-n">{{name}}</span>
                        </button>
                    </li>
                    {{/months}}
                </ol>
                <h3 class="an-h3">{{#str}}panel_new_where, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h3>
                <ul class="an-etapas">
                    {{#stages}}
                    <li><button type="button" class="an-toque an-etapa" data-explica="{{explain}}">
                        <span class="an-etapa-n">{{name}}</span>
                        <span class="an-par an-par-mas"><b>{{#joins}}+{{joins}}{{/joins}}{{^joins}}0{{/joins}}</b><i style="--v: {{av}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                        <span class="an-par an-par-menos"><i style="--v: {{bv}}" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>{{#leaves}}−{{leaves}}{{/leaves}}{{^leaves}}0{{/leaves}}</b></span>
                    </button></li>
                    {{/stages}}
                </ul>
                <div class="an-porque">
                    {{#lists}}
                    <div class="an-lista">
                        <h3 class="an-h3">{{title}}</h3>
                        <ul>{{#rows}}<li class="an-lista-fila{{#out}} sale{{/out}}" style="--v: {{v}}"><span>{{name}}</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>{{n}}</b></li>{{/rows}}</ul>
                    </div>
                    {{/lists}}
                </div>
            </div>
            <aside class="an-explica" data-explica-caja aria-live="polite"><p class="an-reposo"><svg class="an-toca" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#an-toca"/></svg>{{#str}}panel_new_touch, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p></aside>
        </div>
        <p class="def">{{def}}</p>
        <details class="tabla-gemela"><summary>{{#str}}panel_as_table, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</summary>
            <table class="tabla-panel"><thead><tr><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_month, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_joins_cap, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_leaves_cap, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th><th scope="col">{{#str}}panel_new_last_year, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>{{#months}}<tr><th scope="row">{{fullname}}</th><td>{{joinsn}}</td><td>{{leavesn}}</td><td>{{before}}</td></tr>{{/months}}</tbody></table>
        </details>
    </section>
    {{/moves}}

    {{#hasyear}}{{#year}}
    <section class="lamina grafico grafico-saldo{{#ancha}} ancha{{/ancha}}" aria-labelledby="c-sal" id="saldo" data-grafico>
        <h2 id="c-sal">{{title}}</h2>
        <p class="corte">{{cut}}</p>
        <p class="linea-dato" data-linea-dato data-reposo="{{rest}}">{{rest}}</p>
        <div class="libro">
            <p class="libro-extremo libro-inicio"><span>{{startlabel}}</span><b>{{start}}</b></p>
            <ul class="libro-filas">
                {{#rows}}
                <li class="libro-fila{{#out}} sale{{/out}}" data-dato="{{line}}" id="sal-{{key}}">
                    <span class="libro-que">{{name}}</span>
                    <b class="libro-n">{{sign}}</b>
                    <span class="barra-pista" aria-hidden="true"><i class="barra-dato" style="--v: {{v}}" id="sal-b-{{key}}"></i></span>
                </li>
                {{/rows}}
            </ul>
            <p class="libro-extremo libro-final"><span>{{#str}}panel_ended_with, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><b>{{end}}</b><span class="libro-neto">{{net}}</span></p>
            <p class="sello-cuadra" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}}panel_ledger_squares, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
        </div>
        <details class="motivos" id="motivos"><summary>{{#str}}panel_why_they_left, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</summary>
            <ul class="lista-simple motivos-lista" style="--total: {{#rows}}{{#out}}{{n}}{{/out}}{{/rows}}">{{#reasons}}<li class="fila-s motivo" style="--n: {{n}}"><span>{{name}}</span><i class="motivo-barra" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>{{n}}</b></li>{{/reasons}}</ul>
        </details>
        <p class="def">{{def}}</p>
    </section>
    {{/year}}{{/hasyear}}
    {{#hashistory}}{{#history}}
    <section class="lamina grafico grafico-anos{{#ancha}} ancha{{/ancha}}" aria-labelledby="c-anos" id="anos" data-grafico>
        <h2 id="c-anos">{{#str}}panel_roll_by_year, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <p class="corte">{{cut}}</p>
        <p class="linea-dato" data-linea-dato data-reposo="{{rest}}">{{rest}}</p>
        <div class="columnas-caja">
            <ol class="columnas">
                {{#rows}}<li class="columna{{#last}} ultima{{/last}}" data-dato="{{line}}" style="--v: {{v}}" id="anos-{{year}}"><b>{{n}}</b>{{#delta}}<span class="col-delta" aria-hidden="true">{{delta}}</span>{{/delta}}<span class="col-pista" aria-hidden="true"><i id="anos-b-{{year}}"></i></span><span class="col-ano">{{year}}</span></li>{{/rows}}
            </ol>
        </div>
        <p class="def">{{def}}</p>
    </section>
    {{/history}}{{/hashistory}}

    <details class="apartado plegado an-glosario" id="como-se-cuenta">
        <summary><h2>{{#str}}panel_new_how_counted, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2></summary>
        <dl class="an-defs">
            {{#explain}}
            <div class="an-def" id="{{id}}">
                <dt>{{{title}}}</dt>
                <dd>
                    <p><b>{{#str}}panel_new_what_is, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</b> {{{what}}}</p>
                    <p><b>{{#str}}panel_new_how, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</b> {{{how}}}</p>
                    {{#careful}}<p class="an-ojo"><b>{{#str}}panel_new_careful, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</b> {{{careful}}}</p>{{/careful}}
                </dd>
            </div>
            {{/explain}}
        </dl>
    </details>
</div>
